## Keeping this current

Before every release:

```
cargo install cargo-license --locked
cargo license --avoid-build-dependencies --avoid-dev-dependencies
```

Compare the output with the table above. If a dependency was added, removed or
relicensed, this file changes in the same commit as the manifest.
